  "id": "10/G",
  "goal": "Explain cybersickness/VIMS, the symptoms that indicate its onset, why reducing it matters, and the internal and hardware factors that can cause or increase it.",
  "achieves": "Equips the learner with foundational knowledge of a key psycho-physiological and technological issue in XR, enabling them to assess and address cybersickness when understanding or implementing an XR system."
 },
